OL,3,GPRESWATCHCRTE and other Irish media
OL,4,Coutlets evacuated after bomb threats
OL,5,
OL,6,FRTE evacuated its Donnybrook campus
OL,7,Fthis morning after a threatening e-mail
OL,8,Fwas sent to the broadcaster and scores
OL,9,Fof other media outlets across Ireland.
OL,11,FDirector General Kevin Bakhurst said
OL,12,Fthe e-mail arrived at 8.33am and
OL,13,Freached him at 8.40am. After quick
OL,14,Fconsultation with his deputy, a
OL,15,Fcolleague contacted gardai and the
OL,16,Fdecision was taken to evacuate on the
OL,17,Fbasis of staff safety.
OL,23,EPub: 06-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,142,140,200,120,0,100
