OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F141A1793970691
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G2/5
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GPRESWATCHCRTE and other Irish media
OL,4,Coutlets evacuated after bomb threats
OL,5,
OL,6,FGardai are at the scene and the RTE
OL,7,Fbuildings are being searched with
OL,8,Fsniffer dogs. Bakhurst indicated it
OL,9,Fcould be another few hours before staff
OL,10,Fare allowed back in, and RTE has said
OL,11,Fnormal services will resume as soon as
OL,12,Fpossible following consultation with
OL,13,Fgardai.
OL,15,FRTE switched to pre-recorded
OL,16,Fprogramming as a precautionary measure,
OL,17,Fbut Today with David McCullagh stayed
OL,18,Flive on Radio 1, broadcast from the
OL,19,Fstation's roadcaster unit.
OL,23,EPub: 06-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
