OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F141A1793970691
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G3/5
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GPRESWATCHCRTE and other Irish media
OL,4,Coutlets evacuated after bomb threats
OL,5,
OL,6,FBakhurst acknowledged significant
OL,7,Fdisruption but said contingency plans
OL,8,Fwere in place and had been reviewed
OL,9,Frelatively recently. The main
OL,10,Foutstanding risk he flagged was the
OL,11,Flunchtime television bulletin, which
OL,12,Fmay be affected depending on how long
OL,13,Fthe search takes.
OL,15,FMediahaus and Independent News Media
OL,16,Fbriefly evacuated their Talbot Street
OL,17,Foffices in Dublin while security checks
OL,18,Fwere carried out, and staff due to
OL,19,Ftravel in were told to work from home
OL,20,Funtil the alert ends. Virgin Media
OL,21,Freceived the same threat but did not
OL,22,Fevacuate and continued broadcasting.
OL,23,EPub: 06-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
